# A3-O2 additional arrangement native evidence

Exact explicitly selected originals only. Original eight-level acceptance remains complete; this is a separate arrangement amendment. Run exit/diagnostic/head/source observations and native footers retain their own scope, including failures, partials, import/parse-only and unexecuted branches. No full-route, global resource/UID census, universal accepted-file closure, pacing or human balance/readability claim is inferred. Capture pixels remain original; visual inspection is separate evidence. Component declarations do not grant parent earned history or Save/Continue credit.

index.json maps each exact native source digest to a deduplicated unchanged .txt blob. Raw command.json/sources.json/result.json/native.log and run-root receipts are byte copies. Existing failed-original-producer-01 originals are retained when explicitly selected. The file inventory excludes index.json and its detached index.sha256 to avoid circular hashes. The final printed index digest is the pack identity. No original is rewritten.

